# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line endings. The team is split across Windows and WSL/Linux, and without
# this git rewrites CRLF<->LF per machine, so the same file shows up as
# "modified" on a teammate's clone with every line changed. Normalise text to
# LF in the repository; each checkout still gets its platform's endings.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=lf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Binary files - never touch these.
# figures/*.png matters most: phase 1 requires that running inspect.py twice
# produces a byte-identical PNG. Any line-ending rewriting would corrupt the
# file outright and silently break that guarantee.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.png  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.flac binary
*.wav  binary
*.npy  binary
*.pt   binary
